    <subfield code="a">Unique book housed in an antique film canister. The book is made with handmade paper and the text is typewritten. Hamrick's text is a mixture of personal stories set in Georgia, and music lyrics with sexual innuendos involving music music lyrics. The stories are told by a progressively older narrator, and is a kind of coming of age book, or self-portrait with a written soundtrack. </subfield>
